#: quicktree.php
msgid "Save To New Tree"
msgstr "Ku Keydi Geed Cusub"

#: quicktree.php
msgid "Save To Branch"
msgstr "Ku Keydi Laan"

#: quicktree.php
msgid "Clear All Graphs"
msgstr "Nadiifi Dhammaan Jaantusyada"

#: quicktree.php
msgid "Graph Added to QuickTree"
msgstr "Jaantuska waxaa lagu daray QuickTree"

#: quicktree.php
#, php-format
msgid "Graph %s added to QuickTree.  Goto the QuickTree page to move all Graphs to a new or existing Tree."
msgstr "Jaantuska %s waxaa lagu daray QuickTree. Tag bogga QuickTree si aad dhammaan Jaantusyada ugu rarto Geed cusub ama mid hore u jiray."

#: quicktree.php
msgid "Graph Not Added to QuickTree"
msgstr "Jaantuska laguma darin QuickTree"

#: quicktree.php
#, php-format
msgid "Graph %s was NOT added to QuickTree as it's already there waiting to be placed on a Tree.  Goto the QuickTree page to move all Graphs to a new or existing Tree."
msgstr "Jaantuska %s LAGUMA darin QuickTree maadaama uu horey ugu jiray isagoo sugaya in la dhigo Geed. Tag bogga QuickTree si aad dhammaan Jaantusyada ugu rarto Geed cusub ama mid hore u jiray."

#: quicktree.php
msgid "Graph Not Specified.  Not added to QuickTree"
msgstr "Jaantus lama cayimin. Laguma darin QuickTree"

#: quicktree.php
msgid "No Graph was added to QuickTree as no Graph was specified."
msgstr "Wax Jaantus ah laguma darin QuickTree maadaama aan wax Jaantus ah la cayimin."

#: quicktree.php
msgid "Click 'Continue' to Add the following Tree."
msgstr "Guji 'Sii wad' si aad ugu darto Geedka soo socda."

#: quicktree.php
msgid "Tree Name"
msgstr "Magaca Geedka"

#: quicktree.php
msgid "New Tree"
msgstr "Geed Cusub"

#: quicktree.php
msgid "Branch Name"
msgstr "Magaca Laanta"

#: quicktree.php setup.php
msgid "QuickTree"
msgstr "QuickTree"

#: quicktree.php
msgid "Add To Branch"
msgstr "Ku Dar Laan"

#: quicktree.php
msgid "Cancel"
msgstr "Jooji"

#: quicktree.php
msgid "Continue"
msgstr "Sii wad"

#: quicktree.php
msgid "Click 'Continue' to Add the following Tree Branch."
msgstr "Guji 'Sii wad' si aad ugu darto Laanta Geedka ee soo socota."

#: quicktree.php
msgid "Add to which Graph Tree?"
msgstr "Geedkee Jaantus lagu daraa?"

#: quicktree.php
msgid "QuickTree has Created Tree and/or Branch and added Graphs"
msgstr "QuickTree wuxuu abuuray Geed iyo/ama Laan wuuna ku daray Jaantusyada"

#: quicktree.php
msgid "QuickTree has no Graphs Queued"
msgstr "QuickTree kuma jiraan wax Jaantusyo ah oo safka sugitaanka ku jira"

#: quicktree.php
msgid "Information/Directions"
msgstr "Macluumaad/Tilmaamo"

#: quicktree.php
msgid "The Graphs below are Queue to be added to a Cacti Tree.  You may keep them here for as long as you like, or you can perform one of the following actions"
msgstr "Jaantusyada hoose waxay ku jiraan safka sugitaanka si loogu daro Geedka Cacti. Waad ku hayn kartaa halkan inta aad rabto, ama waxaad samayn kartaa mid ka mid ah ficillada soo socda"

#: quicktree.php
msgid "Save your selection to a new Graph Tree so you can keep them for later and work on something new."
msgstr "Ku keydi xulashadaada Geed Jaantus cusub si aad dib ugu dhigato oo aad wax cusub uga shaqeyso."

#: quicktree.php
msgid "Save your selection as a branch to an existing tree so that they appear in a specific section of an existing tree."
msgstr "Ku keydi xulashadaada iyadoo ah laan ka mid ah geed hore u jiray si ay uga muuqdaan qayb gaar ah oo ka mid ah geed jira."

#: quicktree.php
msgid "Clear all graphs"
msgstr "Nadiifi dhammaan jaantusyada"

#: quicktree.php
msgid "Clear the Graphs on this page from the Graphs Queue so that you have a blank QuickTree ready for new selections"
msgstr "Ka nadiifi Jaantusyada boggan ku jira Safka Sugitaanka Jaantusyada si aad u hesho QuickTree madhan oo diyaar u ah xulashooyin cusub"

#: quicktree.php
msgid "You can manage the individual graphs that appear here by clicking:"
msgstr "Waxaad maamuli kartaa jaantusyada gaarka ah ee halkan ka muuqda adigoo gujinaya:"

#: quicktree.php
msgid "Add"
msgstr "Ku dar"

#: quicktree.php
msgid "Graph View Page"
msgstr "Bogga Muuqaalka Jaantuska"

#: quicktree.php
#, php-format
msgid "This icon is next to a Graph on the %s tab."
msgstr "Astaantan waxay ku ag taallaa Jaantus ku yaalla tab-ka %s."

#: quicktree.php
msgid "Delete"
msgstr "Tirtir"

#: quicktree.php
msgid "This icon next to the Graphs below to remove them from the QuickTree Queue."
msgstr "Astaantan waxay ku ag taallaa Jaantusyada hoose si looga saaro Safka Sugitaanka QuickTree."

#: quicktree.php
msgid "Note:"
msgstr "Xusuusin:"

#: quicktree.php
msgid "Adding, removing or clearing on this page does not affect any other parts of Cacti (only Creating/Saving does)"
msgstr "Ku darista, ka saarista ama nadiifinta boggan ma saameyneyso qaybaha kale ee Cacti (kaliya Abuurista/Keydinta ayaa saameysa)"

